 0:30am – 3pm\n\nPlease join us Sunday\, November 22 from 10:30am to 3:00
 pm\, for our annual family-friendly Chanukah Fair. Bring your friends and 
 family!\nWe’ll have live music with the Jon Frank Quartet from 11 am to 
 1 pm and the Jewish Folk Chorus from 1:30 to 2:15pm.\n\nThe festivities in
 clude:\n\nLocal artisans and their hand-made wares for purchase\n\nRaffle 
 drawing with terrific prizes\n\nChildren’s art activities\n\nLatkes with
  all the trimmings AND veggie/vegan lentil stew\n\nGift shop table with Ch
 anukah cards\, wrapping paper\, and other items to purchase\n\nBake sale\n
 \nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.amtikvah.org\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.
