BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Music of Hey Arnold Live! Feat. Jim Lang & the PS 118 AllStars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T210000
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-17778705@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Music of Hey Arnold
  Live! Featuring Jim Lang & the PS 118 AllStars\nwith special guest Craig 
 Bartlett\n\nWednesday\, November 25 | The Castro\n\nThe Music of Hey Arnol
 d! Live featuring Jim Lang & The PS 118 AllStars celebrates the 30th anniv
 ersary of one of television’s most cherished animated series.\n\nLed by 
 award winning composer Jim Lang\, best known for his unforgettable theme m
 usic\, original songs\, and score for Hey Arnold!\, this one of a kind con
 cert brings the music of the series to life on stage. Blending jazz\, hip 
 hop\, blues\, R&B and funk\, Lang created a sound unlike anything else on 
 television\, helping give Hey Arnold! its heart\, warmth\, humor and soul.
  Thirty years later\, the music continues to connect with fans of all ages
  and inspire musicians around the world.\n\nPerformed by Jim Lang and The 
 PS 118 AllStars\, the evening features the show’s unforgettable themes\,
  fan favorite songs\, and some of the moments that made Hey Arnold! so spe
 cial. Accompanied by multimedia visuals and stories from behind the music\
 , the performance also includes a special guest appearance by series creat
 or Craig Bartlett.\n\nWhether you grew up with Hey Arnold! or are discover
 ing its music for the first time\, this 30th anniversary celebration is a 
 chance to experience one of animation’s most distinctive and enduring sc
 ores performed live by the composer who created it.\n\nall ages\nAnother P
 lanet Entertainment presents\nListed time is doors\n\nDetails: https://dot
 hebay.com/events/2026/11/25/the-music-of-hey-arnold-live-feat-jim-lang-and
 -the-ps-118-allstars-with-special-guestcraig-bartlett-tickets\nSource: DoT
 heBay
