 ard Fri 11/27. From 2 – 6. You can enjoy sets from Katherine Park\, Fran
 ces Ancheta\, Ants Fujinaga\, Bay Station Duo\, Sara Rodenburg\, Joyce Lee
 \, and John Rybak + Friends. The Bistro is conveniently located on the cor
 ner of B Street & Main\, walking distance from the Hayward BART Station\, 
 and there is tons of free parking close by\, both outdoor lots and parking
  garages. They always have a fantastic craft beer selection including Plin
 y on tap (!) and some cheese board type munchies as well. It is cash only 
 but there is an ATM inside and its free to get in!\n2-2:20 Katherine Park2
 :30-2:50 Ant Fujinaga3-3:20 Frances Ancheta3:30-3:50 Sara Rodenburg4-4:30 
