CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:[MOVED FROM THE REGENCY BALLROOM]Goldenvoice Presents\nDream L
 ive Tour\nAmtrac\nwith Special Guest Seb Wildblood\n\nFriday\, November 27
  | The Great Northern\n\nPlease note: this show has moved from The Regency
  Ballroom to The Great Northern.\n\nDoors & show: 10 PM\n\nLong establishe
 d for his chameleonic proficiency\, Amtrac spent the last decade proving h
 imself with melodic house tracks\, infectious indie dance hooks and everyt
 hing in between. Amtrac is a multi-instrumentalist\, vocalist\, producer\,
  and DJ. He’s played sold-out arena shows\, underground clubs and festiv
 als around the world. His recent co-headline tour with Tourist sold out ve
 nues across North America.\n\nHe’s released three full-length albums and
  a slew of varied singles and EPs\, not to mention marquee collaborations 
 with Diplo and Leon Bridges\, Elderbrook\, Shakka and Kaskade. He’s remi
 xed everyone from Bob Moses to Alesso\, Two Door Cinema Club\, Ellie Gould
 ing\, Washed Out\, UNKLE\, Axwell/Ingrosso\, ZHU\, Bob Moses & more. He ru
 ns his own label\, Openers\, named in a nod to the way he’s managed to s
 traddle both the bright lights of the mainstage world and the taste-making
  underground without ever losing sense of who he really is—and still\, h
 e’s never felt quite as focused as this.\n\n21+\n[MOVED FROM THE REGENCY
  BALLROM] Goldenvoice Presents: Dream Live Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nT
 ickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%
 2Fe%2Famtrac-seb-wildblood-tickets-2004964937099%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator%26a
 xssid%3Dtoken_3643773cd0ec%26locale%3Den-US%26originalReferringURL%3Dhttps
 %253A%252F%252Fwww.axs.com%252Fevents%252F1566122%252Famtrac-tickets%253F_
 _cf_chl_tk%253D.SBOLkGn8ycmdMSv4jUxNedjBh1\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/
 events/2026/11/27/amtrac-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
