  solo hits like "Fantasía\," "Me Gustas CC\," and "Tate Quieta\," and his
  acclaimed Private Suite series\, ROA fuses reggaeton\, R&B\, and raw\, em
 otionally driven lyrics into a live show that's as intimate as it is elect
 ric. Fresh off winning Male Breakout Artist of the Year at Premio Lo Nuest
 ro 2026\, don't miss your chance to see one of Latin urban music's fastest
 -rising stars live. General Admission. All Ages.\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice 
 & Zamora Live Present\n\nTickets: https://www.theregencyballroom.com/event
 s/detail/?event_id=1573659\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/3
