BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Function 500 w/ Pulse Finder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261203T230000
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-18112212@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, December 3rd\, 9pm - 2am\n\nLoft / 21+ / Limited Ca
 pacity\n\nWant free entry? Check out the PW Union where members get event 
 access\, drinks\, skip the line\, and more starting at just $12/month or $
 10 with an annual plan: www.publicsf.com/membership\n\nLocal 500 and Publi
 c Works Present:\n\nFunction 500\n\nFor our ninth installment of our month
 ly residency\, we will be hosting local selector\, west coast protector an
 d mortal kombat vinyl disrespector\, Pulse Finder (@pulsefinder).\n\nPulse
  Finder (@pulsefinder) embodies the essence of San Francisco’s undergrou
 nd electronic movement. He is part of the vibrant Vitamin1000 crew\, co-or
 ganizer of the Domain event series\, and is one half of Online Narcotics\,
  a duo that has released tracks on Siah Records and Heist Mode.\n\nPulse F
 inder’s sound can be characterized by his selective choice of potent dan
 ce floor fillers and hard hitting cuts unearthed from deep within the crat
 es. However\, his reverence for the past does not inhibit his ability to i
 ncorporate the contemporary\, it has always been about the sound. His inte
 ntionality and dedication to the craft is palpable and there does not seem
  to be an end in sight.\n\nIn true Local500 (@local500sf) fashion\, we’r
 e continuing to bring love back to Thursday nights in San Francisco. Expec
 t techno\, percussive bass lines\, groove\, and a tighter underground feel
  as we showcase local crews and producers.\n\nLocal500 support: Panderer(@
 panderer.dj) and AGROPOL(@agropol_)\n\nShow up. Support local talent. Be a
 ...\n\n$5-$10\, 21+\nLocal 500 & Public Works Present\n\nTickets: https://
 tixr.com/af/dostuff/215299\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/3
 /local-500-public-works-present-function-500-w-pulse-finder-tickets\nSourc
 e: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7688759;-122.4194268
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35632141/6b45c6da-529a-4d7e-9e06-00860b3834d4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261126T170128Z
LOCATION:Public Works\, 161 Erie Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/3/local-500-public-works-present-f
 unction-500-w-pulse-finder-tickets
END:VEVENT
