DESCRIPTION:charlie ertolaFriday December 4th In Lower Haight!\nThe return
  of Lower Haight Social Club.\nYou are invited to join us at the world fam
 ous Peacock Lounge. Located in beautiful Lower Haight\, come take a trip b
 ack to 1996- Have a drink\, grab a bite\, listen to some tunes\, dance if 
 you want to!\n\nWe have a very nice group of DJs spinning records from 5pm
  until 11pm. We are honored to welcome Broad Strokes\, B-Love\, AngieFromT
 heBay\, Zaynub\, Doc Fu\, and Mista B on the decks. Expect some of your fa
 vorite R&B\, Disco\, Funk\, Dancehall\, Lowrider Oldies\, Lovers Rock\, Bo
 ogie & Soul Music.\nFood & Record Vendors TBA.\nThe Peacock is All Ages\, 
 so Bring the Fam.\nCome Early\, Stay Late. Doors at 5pm.\n$5 Donation at D
 oor\, All Ages\, Positive Attitude A Must. Bring friends & make some new o
 nes. Lower Haight Social Club will be Every First Friday so make sure to m
 ark your calendar.\n#LowerHaightSocialClub #vinyl\n#LowerHaight #sf #frisc
