DESCRIPTION:SF’s 2026 “Winterfest” at Salesforce Park (Dec. 4-6)\nBR
 V Corp.\nIt’s almost time to light up the night! The 7th annual Winterfe
 st returns to TJPA’s Salesforce Park on the weekend of December 4th-6th.
 \nBundle up and join us for a weekend full of festive fun\, including a ho
 liday swing dance\, seasonal movies and crafts\, and the return of our pop
 ular all-day wreath-making party!\n\nFriday\, December 4\, 2026: Holiday L
 ighting Celebration\n5 p.m. – 7 p.m at the Main Plaza\nThe TJPA joins ot
 her downtown venues celebrating the holidays and will feature a park holid
 ay lighting celebration on the evening of December 4th from 5 to 7 p.m. fe
 aturing DJ Umami\, dancing\, crafts\, and a countdown to the lighting of S
 alesforce Park!\nSaturday\, December 5\, 2026: Kids Day\n10 a.m. – 2 p.m
  & 5 – 7 p.m at the Main Plaza\n\n10 am – 2 pm: Gift Wrapping Station\
 nBring a gift and wrap it with complimentary festive paper and bows. While
  supplies last.\n10 – 11am Holiday Toddler Time\, with Blue Bear School 
 of Music\nGet ready to twirl\, tap\, and jingle with a holiday music and m
 ovement class designed just for little ones.\n11 am – 12:30 pm Shimmerin
 g Snowflake Ornament Making\, with GoGo Craft\nCatch the winter magic and 
 create a snowflake ornament! This hands-on workshop guides families throug
 h twisting colorful or metallic chenille stems and embellishing them with 
 vibrant pony beads and rhinestones. Add a hanging loop to turn your snowfl
 ake into a holiday ornament or a winter window decoration. While supplies 
 last.\n11 a...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.tjpa.org/Winterfest\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-2026-winterfest-salesforce-park-dec-46/\nSo
 urce: Funcheap SF\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://www.tjpa.org/transit-cente
 r/activities/winterfest-holiday-lighting-celebration-1?utm_source=caldisco
 very&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2025-1
 2.5-Lighting-Celebration_IMG_8869.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261124T021644Z
LOCATION:Salesforce Park\, 425 Mission St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-2026-winterfest-salesforce-park-dec-46/
END:VEVENT
