DESCRIPTION:DABA • Dogpatch Art & Business AssociationJoin us for the Do
 gpatch Holiday Market on Saturday\, December 12\, from 11:00 AM to 5:00 PM
  on 22nd Street between Illinois and Indiana Streets. Get into the holiday
  spirit as you browse unique gifts\, art\, and handcrafted goods from loca
 l makers\, artists\, and businesses\, all while enjoying music and delicio
 us food and drinks from neighborhood favorites.\n\nEnjoy live music\, deli
 cious bites from neighborhood eateries\, holiday photo ops\, and family-fr
 iendly activities. It’s the perfect way to shop small\, support local\, 
 and celebrate the spirit of Dogpatch.\nAvenue Greenlight generously sponso
 rs this event\, with support from the American Industrial Center\, DABA\, 
 and Revel.\n\n🎨 What to Expect\n\nLocal artists and makers with one-of-
 a-kind gifts\nLive music & performances from neighborhood talent\nFood & d
 rinks from Dogpatch favorites\nFamily activities\, crafts\, music\, and po
 ssibly a visit from Santa\nArt exhibits & open studios throughout the neig
 hborhood\n\n❤️ Why It Matters\nEvery purchase at the Dogpatch Holiday 
 Market supports local artists\, small businesses\, and community programmi
 ng — helping to keep our neighborhood vibrant\, creative\, and connected
  year-round.\n🌟 Details\n\nFree admission\nFamily-friendly\nEasy access
  by Muni T Line and Caltrain (22nd St Station)\nStreet parking and bike pa
 rking are available\n\nOriginal Event Description:\n🔜 DOGPATCH HOLIDAY 
 MARKET🌲 🎈Saturday\, December 12th 11:00-5:00pm 22nd Street 🎁Shopp
 ing•Food & Drinks•Music •Activit...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.
 instagram.com/p/DfQKXBwy_H5\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-dogpatch
 -holiday-market-2026-shopping-live-music/\nSource: Funcheap SF
