DESCRIPTION:© Studio FalloutThe 4th Annual Bat Show 2026: Nocturnal Emiss
 ions & Holiday Havoc!\nFeaturing a Live Performance by BATNAP!\nThursday\,
  December 17\, 2026 | 5–10 PM\n111 Minna Gallery | San Francisco\, CA\nS
 an Francisco\, CA — Winston Smith’s Studio Fallout and legendary punk 
 record label Alternative Tentacles are teaming up once again to present Th
 e 4th Annual Bat Show: Nocturnal Emissions & Holiday Havoc!\, a celebratio
 n of punk art\, creative mischief\, and one of underground culture’s mos
 t recognizable icons.\n\nWinston Smith has been closely associated with Je
 llo Biafra and Alternative Tentacles since the label’s early days\, crea
 ting artwork for its records\, posters\, and promotional materials. In 198
 2\, he designed the label’s iconic bat emblem\, which has remained a rec
 ognizable part of Alternative Tentacles’ identity for more than four dec
 ades.\nThis year’s exhibition brings together artists from near and far\
 , each offering their own interpretation of Winston’s original bat. From
  painting and collage to sculpture and unexpected three-dimensional creati
 ons\, the show celebrates the enduring influence of punk’s DIY spirit an
 d the artists who continue to carry it forward.\nAdding to the evening’s
  festivities will be a live performance by BATNAP!\, an Olympia\, Washingt
 on-based new wave and post-punk duo featuring wEnDy kieRpieC and tOm vArLE
 y. Armed with synthesizers\, guitars\, drum machines\, and a healthy dose 
 of darkwave weirdness\, BATNAP! brings its own brand of musical mischief t
 o this ye...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.studiofallout.com/\nDetails: 
 https://sf.funcheap.com/4th-annual-bat-show-2026-nocturnal-emissions-holid
 ay-havoc-111-minna/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bat-Sh
 ow-BATNAP.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T194955Z
LOCATION:111 Minna Gallery\, 111 Minna St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/4th-annual-bat-show-2026-nocturnal-emissions-h
 oliday-havoc-111-minna/
END:VEVENT
