BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:35th Annual Candlelight Christmas Concert (Mission Dolores Basilic
 a)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T190000
DTSTAMP:20261122T194955Z
UID:funcheap-1648356@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Jerome LenkThe program will begin with three traditional hymns
  sung in Latin: Hodie Christus Natus Est (Today Christ Is Born)\, Ave Mari
 s Stella (Hail Star of the Sea)\, and Personet Hodie (14th Century carol).
  Subsequent selections will include the 16th Century Spanish carol Riu\, R
 iu\, Chiu\, Mozart’s Fa La La\, traditional English hymn Sussex Carol\, 
 the old Breton melody Come Ye Lofty\, Austrian carol Still\, Still\, Still
 \, and In the Bleak Midwinter (arranged by Alice Parker).\nJerome Lenk wil
 l conduct the Mission Dolores Basilica Choir accompanied by the Mission Do
 lores Basilica Chamber Orchestra.\nThe audience will be encouraged to join
  in singing popular Christmas carols from around the world\, including God
  Bless You Merry Gentlemen\, It Came Upon a Midnight Clear\, Deck the Hall
 \, Silent Night\, and Angels from the Realms of Glory.\n\n$23.00\n\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/35th-annual-candlelight-christmas-concert-missi
 on-dolores-basilica/\nSource: Funcheap SF
